+ *   - busy: GMU CX power counter 0, which counts XO ticks (19.2 MHz) while the GPU is busy -- the counter kgsl
+ *     (a6xx_power_stats: busy_us = ticks * 10 / 192) and Linux (a6xx_gpu_busy, also for the GMU wrapper of the a610)
